#
# OrielOS High Contrast Evening: one of OrielOS's four high-contrast colour schemes, for people who need text and
# controls to stand out as much as possible. Left Alt+Left Shift+Print Screen turns the chosen one on
# and off (orielos-accessibility-keys).

